{"uid":"efa056e101f216e6","name":"test_a_line_break_in_a_title_cannot_forge_calendar_properties","fullName":"tests.api.regressions.test_published_vulnerabilities#test_a_line_break_in_a_title_cannot_forge_calendar_properties","time":{"start":1790150840084,"stop":1790150840670,"duration":586},"description":"CVE-2026-35601.\n\nA line break in a task title used to end its SUMMARY line in the\ncalendar the product generates, so whatever followed became properties\nof their own.\n\nRead by the rules of RFC 5545 rather than by searching the text. A fixed\nserver still sends the characters `X-INJECTED`, escaped inside the one\nSUMMARY value, and a text search would call it vulnerable. Only parsing\nthe content lines tells a forged property from text that looks like one.\n","descriptionHtml":"<p>CVE-2026-35601.</p>\n<p>A line break in a task title used to end its SUMMARY line in the<br />\ncalendar the product generates, so whatever followed became properties<br />\nof their own.</p>\n<p>Read by the rules of RFC 5545 rather than by searching the text. A fixed<br />\nserver still sends the characters <code>X-INJECTED</code>, escaped inside the one<br />\nSUMMARY value, and a text search would call it vulnerable. Only parsing<br />\nthe content lines tells a forged property from text that looks like one.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"mailpit","time":{"start":1790150812567,"stop":1790150812568,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"hasContent":false,"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"base_url","time":{"start":1790150812567,"stop":1790150812567,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"hasContent":false,"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"settings","time